==Esperanto==

===Etymology===
From {{der|eo|fr|montrer}}, from {{der|eo|la|mōnstrō||I show, point out, indicate}}, from {{m|la|mōnstrum||divine omen indicating misfortune}}. Compare {{cog|it|mostrare}}, {{cog|pt|-}} and {{cog|es|mostrar}}, obsolete {{cog|en|[[muster#Verb|muster]]}}. {{doublet|eo|monstro}}.

